  "description": "<p>This task is to create a utility that runs against a <b>stopped</b> Fedora repository, </p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>traversing resources,</li>\n\t<li>looking for properties of type WEAKREFERENCE or REFERENCE,</li>\n\t<li>with values that reference non-existent resources,</li>\n\t<li>and removing the dead reference property values.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>This utility will likely follow a similar model as:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-upgrade-utils/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/upgrade/utils/TechnicalMetadataMigrator.java#L51\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-upgrade-utils/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/upgrade/utils/TechnicalMetadataMigrator.java#L51</a></p>\n\n<p>Completion of this task is defined by:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>first running a script, TBD (<a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8aead670b8006e2516cc\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8aead670b8006e2516cc\" data-account-id=\"5fca8aead670b8006e2516cc\" accountid=\"5fca8aead670b8006e2516cc\" rel=\"noreferrer\">kefo</a>?), that detects dead references,</li>\n\t<li>followed by running this utility</li>\n\t<li>followed by running the initial script again... showing no dead references.</li>\n</ul>\n",
